<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arden Realty.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arden Realty.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hash explained Arden is an &quot;office REIT that focuses on acquiring, owning and managing Class A and B+ quality office properties in Southern California. We believe that Arden can use its local market experience and strong balance sheet to take advantage of what we believe will be slow but significant recovery in the Southern California office market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The funds from operations estimates are $2.10 per share in 1997 and $2.31 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Total return over the next 12 months should be about 26 percent, Hash said.</p>
</text>
